## Interface: 16001
## Title: Grimoire
## Notes: The WoW Forever field guide in game: a leveling guide with an arrow and the route on your map, gear upgrades for your build, your talent build point by point, dungeon quests and loot, rare alerts, a raid buff check, a timer for Sayge's fortune, auction prices and a selling tab, Legacy challenges and every Grimoire guide.
